          "_name": "image1",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image1\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/6961082216652a286e8e39b4-795x1020.png\" alt=\"Slim Matrix\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style pt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n                    Image Description</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>What is Burn Tide™ ?</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Slim Metrix is a premium weight management and metabolism support supplement developed to promote healthy weight goals, sustained energy, and overall wellness. Crafted with a powerful blend of plant-based ingredients, Slim Metrix is designed to support metabolic efficiency, encourage healthy fat metabolism, and help the body convert nutrients into usable energy more effectively. By supporting key metabolic functions, the formula helps maintain steady energy levels, reduce occasional fatigue, and promote an active, healthy lifestyle. When combined with balanced nutrition and regular exercise, Slim Metrix provides comprehensive support for healthy weight management, metabolic health, and long-term vitality, making it an ideal choice for individuals seeking a natural approach to wellness and energy support.\n<br>\n<br>A key focus of Slim Metrix is cellular energy support. Healthy cells depend on efficient energy production to carry out essential functions such as metabolism, nutrient processing, and fat utilization. When these processes slow down, it may affect overall energy balance and metabolic performance. Slim Metrix is formulated to help support these foundational functions, encouraging the body to operate more efficiently and maintain a healthier internal balance.\n<br>\n<br>Slim Metrix supplement combines well-known, research-supported ingredients associated with metabolic wellness. For example, Berberine is widely studied for its role in supporting healthy metabolism, while Cinnamon extract is known for helping maintain balanced glucose metabolism. Additionally Slim Metric, Chromium contributes by assisting the body in the efficient breakdown and conversion of carbohydrates, fats, and proteins into usable energy, supporting overall metabolic balance throughout the day.\n<br>\n<br>Unlike many conventional weight management products, Slim Metrix is formulated without harsh stimulants or unnecessary fillers. Its non-GMO composition is designed to provide gentle, consistent support for metabolism, appetite regulation, and daily vitality. With 30 servings per bottle, Slim Metrix offers a convenient and simple way to integrate metabolic and wellness support into a daily routine.<br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tmIu46GhV9",
          "_anchor": "image1-1t",
