              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#831c88"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><div><b>How Does Alpha Steel Work?</b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Slim Metrix works by supporting the body’s natural metabolic and energy systems, helping improve how efficiently nutrients are converted into usable fuel. Its plant-based formula is designed to enhance cellular activity, encouraging better energy production and helping the body maintain a balanced metabolism. This internal support may contribute to healthier weight management and improved daily vitality over time.\n<br>\n<br>At its core, Slim Metrix focuses on improving metabolic efficiency at the cellular level. By helping the body utilize calories more effectively, it supports steady energy release and encourages more efficient fat metabolism. This allows users to maintain consistent energy throughout the day without depending on stimulant-based ingredients or experiencing sudden energy crashes. Slim Metrix supplement is intended to work gradually, aligning with the body’s natural rhythms rather than forcing rapid changes.\n<br>\n<br>Slim Metrix also provides antioxidant-supporting nutrients that help protect cells from oxidative stress, which can negatively impact energy levels and metabolic performance. Supporting cellular health is essential for maintaining overall balance, reducing fatigue, and promoting sustained physical and mental performance.\n<br>\n<br>With regular use, Slim Metrix supports a more efficient metabolism, steady energy production, and improved overall wellness. When paired with a healthy diet and active lifestyle, it can serve as a supportive addition to long-term weight management and everyday health goals.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
