          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Every serving of Slim Metrix delivers a precisely formulated blend of natural ingredients chosen to support metabolic function, energy balance, and healthy weight management. Each component is included for its specific role in helping the body optimize energy use, support a healthy appetite response, and encourage overall physical well-being.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vixsZU9E52",
          "_anchor": "content5-7a",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ol": {
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem"
                },
                "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                  "counter-reset": "myCounter",
                  "li": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "counter-increment": "myCounter",
                      "content": "counter(myCounter)",
                      "line-height": "40px",
                      "transition": "all .2s",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "& when (@squareCounters)": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#26a928"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content9",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content9\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized Counters\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Square Counters\" name=\"squareCounters\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#831c88\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Red Boost Ingredients</b></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ol>\n                        <li><b>Green Tea Leaf Extract: </b>Slim Metrix contains Green Tea Leaf Extract, a powerful antioxidant-rich ingredient known for its metabolism-supporting properties. In Slim Metrix, it helps support thermogenesis and encourages the body to burn calories more efficiently while also promoting clean, natural energy that supports an active lifestyle.</li><li><b>Chromium: </b>Slim Metrix includes Chromium, an essential trace mineral that plays an important role in supporting healthy blood sugar regulation. Within Slim Metrix supplement, it helps maintain balanced glucose levels, reduce cravings, and support steady energy release throughout the day, contributing to overall metabolic stability.</li><li><b>Garcinia Cambogia Extract: </b>Garcinia Cambogia Extract, a well-known botanical used in weight management formulas. In Slim Metrix, its active compound HCA may help support appetite control and feelings of fullness, making it easier to maintain balanced calorie intake and support healthy eating habits.</li><li><b>L-Carnitine: </b>Slim Metrix is formulated with L-Carnitine, a key nutrient involved in energy production. Within Slim Metrix capsule, it helps transport fatty acids into the mitochondria where they are converted into energy, supporting improved fat utilization, endurance, and daily physical performance<b>.</b></li><li><b>Cayenne Pepper Extract:</b> Cayenne Pepper Extract, which supports natural thermogenic activity. In Slim Metrix, it may help increase calorie expenditure through heat production while also supporting healthy circulation and digestive function, enhancing overall metabolic support.</li><li><b>Magnesium: </b>Slim Metrix contains Magnesium, an essential mineral involved in hundreds of metabolic processes. Within Slim Metrix supplement, it supports energy production, muscle function, and helps reduce fatigue, contributing to steady energy and overall wellness.</li><li><b>Alpha Lipoic Acid:</b> Slim Metrix features Alpha Lipoic Acid, a powerful antioxidant that supports cellular energy and glucose metabolism. It helps the body convert nutrients into usable energy while supporting insulin sensitivity and protecting cells from oxidative stress, enhancing overall metabolic efficiency and mitochondrial health.</li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li><li><b>\n</b></li></ol><ol>\n                    </ol>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tBZlr2ESDv",
