          },
          "_name": "people5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"people5 mbr-embla\" group=\"People\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"embla\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" inline>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" inline>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <header>Carousel</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"autoplay\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Interval\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" step=\"1\" condition=\"autoplay\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Loop\" name=\"loop\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Draggable\" name=\"draggable\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrows\" title=\"Arrows\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrowsMobile\" title=\"Mobile Arrows\" condition=\"arrows\">\n        <header>Slides</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"gap\" title=\"Gap\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Title\" name=\"showDesk\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"position-relative text-center\">\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><p><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; Real Slim Metrix™ Users\n<br></b></p><p><b>Real Life-Changing Results</b></p></h3>\n\n        <div class=\"embla\" data-loop=\"{{loop}}\" data-auto-play=\"{{autoplay}}\" data-auto-play-interval=\"{{interval}}\" data-draggable=\"{{draggable}}\" data-skip-snaps=\"true\" data-align=\"center\">\n            <div class=\"embla__viewport\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n                <div class=\"embla__container\">\n                    <div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item active\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                        <div class=\"user\">\n                            <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper position-relative\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/tmpigdnqa-v.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">Thank you Slim Metrix forumula…\n<br>\n<br>“I used to feel exhausted by mid-afternoon and had trouble maintaining focus during the day. After adding Slim Metrix to my daily routine, I noticed more stable energy levels and better concentration from morning to evening. I also appreciate that it’s made with natural ingredients, and I haven’t experienced the jitters I used to get from other products. It has become an easy part of my wellness routine, and I’m satisfied with the improvements I’ve experienced so far.”</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Amanda G.</b></div>\n                            <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">Chicago, USA</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                        <div class=\"user\">\n                            <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper position-relative\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/tmpckiv7jxw.webp\" alt=\"Slim Tide Review 1\" data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">I loved Slim Metrix…\n<br>\n<br>“Since I started using Slim Metrix daily, I’ve noticed a steady improvement in my overall energy and well-being. I feel more active, lighter, and more engaged throughout the day. It’s very convenient to take just one capsule, which makes it easy to stay consistent. While results may vary from person to person, I’ve personally been very happy with my experience and plan to continue using it as part of my healthy lifestyle.”</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Elizabeth B.</b></div>\n                            <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">Wyoming, USA</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                        <div class=\"user\">\n                            <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper position-relative\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/tmpgp-6ws9m.webp\" alt=\"Slim Tide Review 3\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">The supplement change my life…\n<br>\n<br>“I’ve tried several wellness supplements over the years, but Slim Metrix has been one of the most consistent for me. After a few weeks of use, I felt more energetic, motivated, and positive about my overall health journey. What I like most is the smooth, balanced energy it provides without the uncomfortable side effects I’ve had with other products. It fits easily into my daily routine, and my overall experience has been very positive.”<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\"><b>Tom M.</b></div>\n                            <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">NY, USA</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--prev\">\n                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--next\">\n                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
